 "brief": "Shehab Wire reported that a lawmaker from the far-right Jewish Power party introduced legislation in the Knesset that would permanently prohibit work permits for Palestinians from the West Bank and Gaza. The bill seeks to enshrine as law the employment restrictions imposed since October 2023, transforming temporary measures into permanent statute.\n\nThe proposal would have wide economic and livelihood consequences for Palestinian workers, many of whom have depended on employment inside Israel for income.",
